## Rows skipped
- et-a #46. Q16–Q20 stay body lines. Turning them into headings, or removing U+200B lines, would change the heading-level sequence or the ZWSP/block count against the Korean source.
- et-a #50. `TWD 1.57M` stays byte-identical (R12 / team bio pin). Not rewritten as “1,57 miljonit TWD”.
- et-a #52 and et-b #21. Space as thousands separator fails `NUMBER_THOUSAND_STYLE.et = dot` (R14). Kept `500.000`, `1.579.589`, `TWD 25.000.000`, and the decimal comma `0,5`.
- et-a #54. Hangul remains only inside the `url` values of columns 008 and 009.
- 013 and 015 one-sentence paragraphs were not merged. Each dangling clause was finished inside its own block.
- Adessive month names (`detsembril` and the like) were not used. They are absent from `DATE_MONTH_NAMES`, and the date pattern needs a space after the nominative month. Dates were recast as nominative predicates the checker still parses (`jõustumiskuupäev on 27. detsember 2023`, `mille kuupäev on 24. jaanuar 2022`, `25. juuli 2026. aasta seisuga`). Frontmatter `date_display` was not touched.
- Gender. Estonian `ta` / `advokaat` / first person do not mark gender. No feminine inflection was invented. The male manager in 008 and the male client in 010 stay male.
- “Võite tasuta uurida” in 015 stays. It is the municipal lookup, not a free consultation.
- “ei luba järeldada / järeldust / õiguslikku järeldust” stays (inference, not a promise). “Hüvitise olemasolu ei luba piiramata…” stays in the permit sense.
- 辦法 stays `määrus`. Office names `kaubandusamet` and `kaubandusarengu amet` stay. `õigussubjekt` / `õigussubjektsus` stay. “lapse parimad huvid”, “parima müügitulemuse” (case fact), and “ainus lahendus” inside a denial stay.

## Systemic patterns (net change in the diff)
- Promise denials (`ei tõota` +9, `ei anna lubadust` +8, `lubadust ei` +4), including “kindlat tulemust” in 001, 002, and 004. Inference “ei luba järeldada” was left.
- 居留 `elamisõigus` → `elamisluba` (+8 `elamisluba`). 017 immigration status, which has no 居留 gloss, uses `elamisõigus` as requested.
- 條例 `määrus` → `seadus` (Tööstusinnovatsiooni seadus, töötajate vanaduspensioni seadus). Not 辦法, not `määruskaebus`.
- ROC year `vabariigi aasta*` → `Hiina Vabariigi kalendriaasta*` (+8). No Gregorian year added.
- Nominative date recasts: +11 lines containing `kuupäev on`.
- Misplaced Chinese glosses moved or dropped only when the characters remain on the right word (010, 011, 016, 018, 001 duplicate 建築管理). Glossed digits (112年, 109年度) kept.
- Responsible-entity `subjekt` calques reduced (12 removed on changed lines, 4 still on those lines where the word is legal personality or a remaining label). `õigussubjekt` kept.
- 商業 registration `kaubandus` → `ettevõte` (4 `kaubanduse` removed). Office names kept.
- Taiwan CPA `vandeaudiitor` → `audiitor` (3 removed: team role, 018 kinnitus, 018 “audiitor (會計師)”).
- `peegeldama` calques removed (7). `kindlustama` as “guarantee” → `ei taga` (2). Real insurance words kept.
- `Kuva kõik` → `Vaadake kõiki` (5 labels). `ei saa kasutada` a language → `ei oska` (+8). `saadetis` → `saadetud andmed` (2).
- 004 percent: a space before `%` on non-URL lines only.
- Bare `1` written as `ühe`/`üks` was put back wherever that word is the counted token. The checker’s `\b` is ASCII-only, so `ühe` and `üks` are in the lexicon and still uncounted. Grammar around the digit was kept where it does not drop the digit (`1 kuu pikkuseks`, `1 korra puhul`, `1 aasta pikkuseks`). `kaks`/`kahe` do count and were kept.

